		(uuid "44f45249-753d-476f-8836-ebdbe29954cc")
		(at 100.126806 100)
		(descr "Inset-fed rectangular microstrip patch antenna, 2440 MHz. 52 x 57 mm, patch 37.4 x 27.2 mm, inset 9.76 mm deep in a 0.49 mm notch, feeding 50 ohm (edge resistance 271 ohm). Needs er=4.4 and 1.6 mm between F.Cu and B.Cu. Pad 1 = feed, drive with a 3.059 mm wide 50 ohm microstrip; pad 2 = GND, solid on B.Cu. Radiates broadside, off the top copper layer -- not endfire along the feed line. Keep the board's own copper pours out of the keepout area.")
